  09: . | . | . | . | . | . | .
  10: . | C-6 2 06 ... | . | . | . | . | .
  11: . | . | . | . | . | . | .
  12: . | C-6 2 0A ... | . | . | . | . | G-5 5 0D ...
  13: . | . | . | . | . | . | .
